Package: licorice
Title: Project Functions for the Licorice Gargle Trial Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Matt", "Mulvahill", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Project functions for a reproducible analysis of the licorice
    gargle trial. The package exists so that every function the report uses
    has tests and one home.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
